.TH urlmenu-items 1  "items " 
.SH NAME
urlmenu\-items \- Print the menu as JSON, for an external picker
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBurlmenu items\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIURL\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the menu as JSON, for an external picker
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Print what would run as JSON instead of running it
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIURL\fR]

